WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.750
A projectile is fired from a sprite, and it's its own kind: Projectile.

2
00:00:06.026 --> 00:00:10.051
So a hit is an overlap between a projectile and an enemy.

3
00:00:12.919 --> 00:00:17.469
The engine removes a projectile by itself when it leaves the screen.
